---
/**
 * AiCaps: the brand name in an all-caps spot (nav menus, eyebrows).
 * All caps reads LIVEAiSTUDIOS, only the i lowercase (Jon 2026-10-12).
 * The i opts out of text-transform so an uppercase parent cannot lift it.
 * One wrapping span, so a flex parent (.eyebrow) sees one item, not three.
 * Mixed-case copy keeps writing plain "LiveAiStudios".
 */
---
<span class="ai-caps">LIVEA<span class="brand-i">i</span>STUDIOS</span>
<style>
  .brand-i {
    text-transform: none;
  }
</style>
